(hisses)

00:09:03.575 --> 00:09:04.500
I know, anyway.

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:05.810
But we worked so hard,

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:07.530
but we got to that one song, One Man,

00:09:07.530 --> 00:09:08.900
and it was actually the first time,

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:09.830
'cause I grew up singing opera,

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:11.560
it was the first time I
found like my chest voice,

00:09:11.560 --> 00:09:13.900
my gut voice, like and
really started belting out.

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:15.270
And it was like such a freeing moment.

00:09:15.270 --> 00:09:17.040
- Wait, what's the difference though?

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:18.720
- It was like basically,
oh you know Sister Act?

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:19.730
You know when she does the thing

00:09:19.730 --> 00:09:21.140
with the stomach, Oh Happy Day?

00:09:21.140 --> 00:09:22.910
- So it's like the diaphragm difference.

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:24.370
- Yeah, and it was just using all,

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:26.130
yeah, and it was just kinda
switching gears for me

00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:27.900
from doing opera, and you
have to be so perfect.

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:28.733
And you have to be,

00:09:28.733 --> 00:09:30.820
it became less about
perfection and technique

00:09:30.820 --> 00:09:32.050
and more about passion.

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:34.390
And it was a really, really
awesome moment for me.

00:09:34.390 --> 00:09:35.980
I felt like I was flying on stage.

00:09:35.980 --> 00:09:39.130
I've never told that story
in my whole life, wow.

00:09:39.130 --> 00:09:41.518
I've never told that story.

00:09:41.518 --> 00:09:42.351
Well done.

00:09:42.351 --> 00:09:43.250
- [Anna] I love that.

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:45.590
- Are you looking for a co-host position?

00:09:45.590 --> 00:09:46.930
- Yes I am.

00:09:46.930 --> 00:09:48.880
And I still want to hear you sing it,

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:50.030
but we can do that later.

00:09:50.030 --> 00:09:51.597
- I know, I can't remember it.

00:09:51.597 --> 00:09:52.800
I'm 37.

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:54.180
- Well, we'll work on this.

00:09:54.180 --> 00:09:57.000
- Yes, let's do it, let's do it.

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:59.040
I just love that I look
like Dr. Evil holding

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:00.103
like a, you know.

00:10:01.110 --> 00:10:04.100
- But he's on my team,
I just want you to know.

